{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This expansion introduces two new factions to the game: Atlantis and Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atlantis's strength lies in its powerful cavalry \u2013 the Marauders \u2013 and the unique Machinarium, where you can craft Golems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atlantis' heroes are inspired by Greek mythology \u2013 you can recruit the powerful Atlas or the female mage \u2013 Ka Ree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike the Greek forum, in Atlantis and Egypt, heroes are recruited from the Hall of Honor of Gods and Heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egypt has a single, important ruler. Both Egypt and Atlantis have high-quality desert-hardened infantry with decent resistance to fire and cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excellent Nubian archers and light cavalry support. Egypt's heroes are the gods Anubis and Horus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Atlantis and Egypt stem from the same source, which is why both have the same two unique buildings and the same highest-level units:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Priests of Ra and Guardians of Ra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The factions are added to the main game, allowing players to play alongside four other factions after the addition of this expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, two additional locations for exploration and new special enemies have been added to the main game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3473950?t=1757056640","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757056640","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473950/cab1b75d76688be00e7f2f33b7202265147ffba8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757056640","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473950/cab1b75d76688be00e7f2f33b7202265147ffba8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757056640","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This expansion introduces two new factions to the game: Atlantis and Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atlantis's strength lies in its powerful cavalry \u2013 the Marauders \u2013 and the unique Machinarium, where you can craft Golems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atlantis' heroes are inspired by Greek mythology \u2013 you can recruit the powerful Atlas or the female mage \u2013 Ka Ree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike the Greek forum, in Atlantis and Egypt, heroes are recruited from the Hall of Honor of Gods and Heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egypt has a single, important ruler. Both Egypt and Atlantis have high-quality desert-hardened infantry with decent resistance to fire and cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excellent Nubian archers and light cavalry support. Egypt's heroes are the gods Anubis and Horus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Atlantis and Egypt stem from the same source, which is why both have the same two unique buildings and the same highest-level units:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Priests of Ra and Guardians of Ra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The factions are added to the main game, allowing players to play alongside four other factions after the addition of this expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, two additional locations for exploration and new special enemies have been added to the main game.</p>","developers":["Artificial Worlds"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2967930","name":"Myths and Legends"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473950/header.jpg?t=1757056640","is_free":false,"lega